Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.85,0:00:04.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bad news, Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.40,0:00:13.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ed, do you know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.00,0:00:15.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That means...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.79,0:00:26.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where do you think \Nyou're going, Ed?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.43,0:00:29.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know your every move.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.81,0:00:33.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,S-Sensei... What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.25,0:00:34.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.75,0:00:37.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mean her?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.42,0:00:41.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's our alchemy teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.06,0:00:42.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where's Al?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.14,0:00:43.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.80,0:00:45.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, I beg your pardon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.93,0:00:48.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks for leading us here, when you must be so busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.70,0:00:50.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you know where Al is as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.53,0:00:53.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um, you see...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.20,0:00:56.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Alphonse...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.16,0:00:58.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, is that so? My, my...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.20,0:01:10.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Were you trying to escape by disguising yourself?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.65,0:01:14.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stories about you two reach me quite often, my moronic pupils!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.31,0:01:16.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like how you broke away from my teachings
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.12,0:01:18.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and lowered yourselves to \Nbecome dogs of the military!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.10,0:01:24.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man cannot obtain anything \Nwithout first sacrificing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.85,0:01:29.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In order to obtain anything, \Nsomething of equal value is required.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.10,0:01:34.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is alchemy's \NLaw of Equivalent Exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.83,0:01:40.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At the time, we believed that \Nto be the true way of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.54,0:03:18.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The formal orders for your transfer have come through.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.59,0:03:21.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Starting next week, \Nyou'll be serving in Central, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.38,0:03:23.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.39,0:03:28.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're going to miss you here. You've been quite colorful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.60,0:03:29.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.16,0:03:32.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not as much as when you \Nwere younger, General. Check.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.14,0:03:36.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's now or never, General.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.44,0:03:41.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And here with all of your work, I was able to take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.47,0:03:43.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have my deepest sympathy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.80,0:03:45.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Checkmate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.99,0:03:48.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've lost after all, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.76,0:03:53.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your one victory is my parting gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.15,0:03:54.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I accept it most gratefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.74,0:03:56.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,General...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.36,0:03:59.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,While you're giving away parting gifts,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.95,0:04:02.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have some subordinates whom \NI would like to take with me to Central.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.99,0:04:05.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.75,0:04:07.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.86,0:04:12.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.70,0:04:16.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you two all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.00,0:04:20.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We never expected that Sensei \Nwould come for us, huh, Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.81,0:04:22.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.07,0:04:23.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.67,0:04:26.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She even took away \Nmy silver watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.71,0:04:29.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess we're going \Nstraight to Dublith.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.54,0:04:31.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Still, I'm surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.15,0:04:36.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I expected your teacher to be someone rougher, not a pretty lady like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.37,0:04:39.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about? \NYou've met her before, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.75,0:04:43.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was in Resembool that \NSensei took us on as her pupils.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.42,0:04:46.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In Resembool?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.61,0:04:49.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Remember, when we had all that heavy rain?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.45,0:05:00.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,ECW, 26%; ICW, 34%; \Nlipids, 19%; proteins... um...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.19,0:05:04.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't it be quicker if we just went with the elements composing a human body?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.13,0:05:07.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say, what have you been \Nstudying so hard about lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.76,0:05:09.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a secret!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.36,0:05:11.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It doesn't have anything to do with you, Winry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.14,0:05:14.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You sneaks! You're always \Nkeeping secrets between you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.00,0:05:16.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.21,0:05:19.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're having stew \Nfor supper tonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.39,0:05:22.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay! We'll see you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.39,0:05:20.29,Dialogue Alt,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.62,0:05:25.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whoever invented stew is great!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.86,0:05:28.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's got milk in it, \Nbut it's still so delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.58,0:05:29.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you going on about?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.80,0:05:34.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The idea of sticking milk into \Nvegetable soup was awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.24,0:05:38.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Scientists need to change over to that kind of thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.64,0:05:47.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There are limits to what we can do \Nstudying alone, Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.00,0:05:51.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't make it on \Nour knowledge alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.05,0:05:51.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.67,0:05:56.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder what we're missing for human transmutation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.35,0:06:00.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why is human transmutation forbidden in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.70,0:06:04.52,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,Isn't it because it's a dangerous transmutation that no one has succeeded at?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.52,0:06:07.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Remember, they say that a whole country was destroyed in one night...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.47,0:06:11.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The story of the Philosopher's Stone in the eastern desert, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.55,0:06:14.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right, right. It tells of them \Ntrying to create a complete human,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.87,0:06:16.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but the whole population got dragged into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.93,0:06:20.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's just a fairy tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.77,0:06:23.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,His formulas...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.39,0:06:30.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If we can make sense of this...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.03,0:06:32.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.60,0:06:37.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's written there that human transmutation is forbidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.64,0:06:40.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've made up my mind, Al.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.64,0:06:43.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're going to bring \NMom back to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.83,0:06:57.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I sure hope the river \Ndoesn't give way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.53,0:07:02.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hold it, you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.95,0:07:04.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're going to go help!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.15,0:07:22.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is bad. Hey! \NBring more sandbags here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.52,0:07:28.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you doing?! It's dangerous there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.15,0:07:28.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.93,0:07:33.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.09,0:07:41.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The transmutation circle!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.49,0:07:44.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.07,0:07:45.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,H-Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.39,0:07:48.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is dangerous, \Nso please keep back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.56,0:07:50.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's what I should \Nbe saying to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.36,0:07:52.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get out of there, quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.00,0:07:56.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whoa...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.64,0:08:08.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.54,0:08:10.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She didn't even use \Na transmutation circle!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.11,0:08:13.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That huge amount of mass, all at once...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.98,0:08:18.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That should hold it for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.25,0:08:21.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable. Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.02,0:08:25.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just a couple passing through.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.73,0:08:28.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where's the nearest hospital?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.62,0:08:28.79,Dialogue Alt,,0,0,0,,A doctor! Get a doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.79,0:08:30.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, stay with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.61,0:08:40.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You really saved us. \NResembool is in your debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.33,0:08:42.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please, let us through.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.05,0:08:43.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pardon us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.58,0:08:46.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um, Auntie?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.31,0:08:51.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who are you calling your auntie?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.46,0:08:53.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,W-We're sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.25,0:08:56.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,P-Please, take us on as pupils,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.88,0:08:57.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.97,0:08:59.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pupils?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.22,0:09:02.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're able to use a little alchemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.85,0:09:05.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We want to become \Nbetter at it, so please!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.47,0:09:06.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.80,0:09:07.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why not?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.20,0:09:10.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't take on pupils.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.39,0:09:13.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We have a store, so we have to be getting back to Dublith.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.19,0:09:16.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take us with you! Take us as pupils!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.45,0:09:18.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah! How pesky!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.18,0:09:22.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you do learn alchemy, \Nwhat do you two want to do with it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.26,0:09:26.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.47,0:09:27.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.16,0:09:30.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We want to be helpful to others!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.15,0:09:31.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What about your parents' permission?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.79,0:09:34.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, about that...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.18,0:09:39.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those two don't have any parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.66,0:09:42.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who \Nlooks after them now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.64,0:09:58.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just don't know \Nhow to handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.44,0:10:05.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One month...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.24,0:10:08.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can I take them for \Nprovisional training?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.63,0:10:11.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To see if it's really worth teaching them alchemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.45,0:10:15.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please allow me to ascertain \Nthe talents that these children have.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.64,0:10:17.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And if they don't have any talent?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.21,0:10:20.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll send them right back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.06,0:10:22.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And if we pass our \Nprovisional training?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.96,0:10:27.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then we'll proceed to \Nfull-fledged training.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.74,0:10:36.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We won't be coming back in a month!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.53,0:10:38.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I knew you'd say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.17,0:10:41.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Training! Training!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.50,0:10:42.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Training! Training!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.29,0:10:45.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sure there must be \Na huge laboratory there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.80,0:10:47.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And maybe we can \Nread lots of books!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.61,0:10:50.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure we can! \NIt's training, after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.38,0:10:51.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.74,0:10:53.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei, you performed an incredible transmutation back there
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.99,0:10:56.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,without even a transmutation circle, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.83,0:11:00.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei, by any chance, \Nare you a State Alchemist?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.55,0:11:04.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you lump me in with those dogs of the military,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.16,0:11:06.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,who can calmly take \Npeople's lives if ordered to!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.54,0:11:18.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.62,0:11:20.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That person from back then...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.46,0:11:21.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.20,0:11:24.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.84,0:11:26.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's make a break for it, Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.15,0:11:31.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.80,0:11:38.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Looks like you still haven't learned your lesson, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.61,0:11:42.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Check.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.40,0:11:44.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,W-Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.55,0:11:45.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.51,0:11:47.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aw, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.51,0:11:47.67,Dialogue Alt,,0,0,0,,What's up with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.67,0:11:50.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I heard it's a style of chess from the eastern island countries.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.73,0:11:54.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes? Yes, he's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.74,0:11:58.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That sure was fun \Nthe other night, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.71,0:12:01.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, about this weekend...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.14,0:12:03.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's okay, it's okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.21,0:12:07.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, hello. I'm a little busy right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.00,0:12:12.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's got it fixed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.66,0:12:13.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.45,0:12:17.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.86,0:12:31.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm asking you,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.60,0:12:33.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,by all means, \Nplease include me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.83,0:12:38.19,Dialogue,,20,20,0,,When you were in the Investigations Department, \Nyou served under Hughes, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.96,0:12:41.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.24,0:12:53.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Master Sergeant Kain Fuery,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.31,0:12:55.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Second Lieutenant Heymans Breda,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.31,0:12:57.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Second Lieutenant Jean Havoc,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.43,0:12:58.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,First Lieutenant Riza Hawkeye,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.70,0:13:01.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Warrant Officer Vato Falman—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.16,0:13:05.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,it has been decided that these five will transfer with me to Central.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.50,0:13:06.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I will accept no objections.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.83,0:13:08.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.93,0:13:16.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We didn't get away after all, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.15,0:13:17.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nope...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.49,0:13:20.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I get chills just thinking about what's going to happen now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.28,0:13:24.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.65,0:13:27.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Menny! How is Chico doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.29,0:13:29.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They say she's about \Nto have her babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.66,0:13:33.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that right? \NThat'll liven things up, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.01,0:13:34.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Izumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.37,0:13:35.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Welcome back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.85,0:13:36.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mason-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.24,0:13:39.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? Edward-kun, \Nit's been too long!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.09,0:13:43.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've really grown a lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.64,0:13:45.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is what pisses me off...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.73,0:13:48.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? Who is this in the armor?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.26,0:13:52.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Er, his younger brother, Alphonse.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.56,0:13:56.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've really grown a lot...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.15,0:14:03.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? Aren't you eating?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.54,0:14:04.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,N-No...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.96,0:14:06.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.57,0:14:08.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.02,0:14:10.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al-kun, you eat too. \NIt's delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.57,0:14:12.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm already full.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.30,0:14:19.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've had quite a brutal journey, \Nhaven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.26,0:14:21.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't be doing such dangerous things.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.82,0:14:26.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But it hasn't been all terrible. \NWe've also helped people.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.72,0:14:31.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right, we helped deliver a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.10,0:14:36.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Silly, you call that helping? \NAll we did is get all flustered.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.95,0:14:38.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.83,0:14:43.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But then, the family helps out as the mother risks her life,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.71,0:14:47.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and everyone is blessed when a person is born.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.43,0:14:48.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.93,0:14:51.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's the way you guys \Nreceived life, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.18,0:14:54.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take pride in the life you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.21,0:14:58.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it, \NIzumi-san, do you have any children?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.82,0:15:04.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey there, you know, this...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.67,0:15:07.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Alchemy! You must've gotten better, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.90,0:15:09.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Show me something!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.11,0:15:12.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure, as much as you want. Al...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.26,0:15:14.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll come too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.19,0:15:17.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Izumi...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.85,0:15:21.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that so? They watched a life being born, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.78,0:15:24.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those children had themselves a nice experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.09,0:15:28.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.80,0:15:33.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've gotten good, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.71,0:15:36.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm next.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.46,0:15:41.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei, welcome home!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.85,0:15:42.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Welcome home!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.25,0:15:46.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei, my train is broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.30,0:15:47.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.20,0:15:50.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The axle broke, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.28,0:15:51.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let me have that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.20,0:15:54.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fix it with alchemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.51,0:15:58.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nuh-uh. Don't rely on \Nalchemy for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.23,0:16:00.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fix whatever you can fix \Nby yourself on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.10,0:16:03.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There, all done.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.59,0:16:05.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ew, that's ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.61,0:16:08.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.03,0:16:10.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you don't want it \Nfixed so ungracefully,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.38,0:16:12.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,be more careful with it \Nso it doesn't break.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.16,0:16:17.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei, thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.18,0:16:20.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll be back when I break it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.92,0:16:22.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't{\i0} break it, I said...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.88,0:16:26.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei! Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.82,0:16:29.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Menny?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.94,0:16:32.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chico... It's Chico!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.11,0:16:45.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chico's up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.79,0:16:46.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.68,0:17:04.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nice catch!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.32,0:17:09.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chico...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.20,0:17:11.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chico...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.92,0:17:15.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei, is Chico broken?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.33,0:17:21.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-mm, no. She died.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.16,0:17:25.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei, fix Chico!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.35,0:17:27.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Izumi-sensei, you can make anything, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.95,0:17:29.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, as far as Chico goes...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.78,0:17:32.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.86,0:17:35.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A life is different \Nfrom a thing, you see,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.41,0:17:37.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and I am not God.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.47,0:17:40.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chico's life has ended, \Nand she isn't coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.15,0:17:43.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.50,0:17:47.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But... up until just a while ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.58,0:17:53.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I cannot create a life for Chico,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.14,0:17:56.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but I can make a grave for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.76,0:18:06.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When something is alive, \Nthat life will expire at some point.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.19,0:18:08.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The body will return to the earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.58,0:18:10.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,where flowers will bloom on top of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.15,0:18:14.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Their spirit will serve to nourish other people's feelings
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.78,0:18:17.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and continue to live on \Ninside their hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.74,0:18:22.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everything in the world \Nflows around and circulates.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.02,0:18:25.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,People's lives are like that as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.11,0:18:39.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even though I know \Nas much about it as I do,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.10,0:18:44.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,it's still so hard to make \Na child understand death.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.33,0:18:50.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.21,0:18:55.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,have you ever wanted to \Nbring someone back to life?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.07,0:18:59.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's the second time \Nyou've asked that question.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.78,0:19:03.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was only wondering, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.48,0:19:06.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ouch...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.86,0:19:09.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What does that have \Nto do with anything?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.67,0:19:12.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The basis of the transmutation circle \Nis the power of the circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.66,0:19:14.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The circle demonstrates the circulation of power,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.93,0:19:17.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and through the act of drawing it,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.20,0:19:19.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the invoking of that power becomes possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.01,0:19:32.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By knowing the laws and flow of power, you can contend with all things.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.25,0:19:39.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those who would create things after accepting and understanding this—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.05,0:19:41.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,they are alchemists.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.88,0:19:46.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The world constantly follows the motion of a great current.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.05,0:19:50.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The death of people \Nis part of that flow,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.10,0:19:53.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and as such, you must not think about bringing them back to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.52,0:20:00.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, that armor is empty on the inside, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.82,0:20:04.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ed's arm and leg are \NAutomail as well, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.21,0:20:05.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,H-How did you...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.86,0:20:07.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The weight from when I threw you...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.77,0:20:10.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,your left footsteps sounding \Ndifferent from your right ones...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.04,0:20:12.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you think I wouldn't notice? \NYou fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.69,0:20:15.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.31,0:20:18.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Earlier, you did not use \Na transmutation circle, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.81,0:20:24.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't have happened to have seen {\i1}it{\i0}, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.74,0:20:28.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.89,0:20:31.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.54,0:20:33.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tell me everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.70,0:20:37.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.93,0:20:39.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.30,0:20:41.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.46,0:20:52.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,transmuted... our mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.77,0:23:40.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fullmetal Alchemist{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.52,0:23:44.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Episode 28: "One Is All, All Is One"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.56,0:23:48.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We are so very small.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.59,0:23:52.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However, we have everything in the world within us.
